  "body": "## Finding description and impact\n\nThe constructor of HypoVault.sol includes the following line:\n\n```solidity\n// HypoVault.sol - Constructor\nconstructor(address _underlyingToken, address _manager, IVaultAccountant _accountant, uint256 _performanceFeeBps) {\n    // ...\n    totalSupply = 1_000_000;\n}\n```\n\n**ERC-20 Invariants**:\n    - **`balanceOf`** initialized as empty mapping\n    - Sum of balances = 0 ≠ totalSupply (1M)\n    - Violates ERC-20 specification\n**First Deposit Impact**: Pre-minted shares without backing assets\n\n## First Depositor Exploitation \nDeposit Flow:\n```solidity\n// fulfillDeposits()\nuint256 totalAssets = ... + 1;  // Becomes 1 when NAV=0\nuint256 sharesReceived = (assetsToFulfill * _totalSupply) / totalAssets;\n```\nScenario:\n- First deposit: 1,000 assets\n- Calculation: (1,000 × 1,000,000) / 1 = 1,000,000,000 shares\n-> Result: 1,000 assets → 1 billion shares\n\nPost-Deposit State Analysis:\nBalances:\n- Depositor: 1,000,000,000 shares\n- Others: 0 shares\n- ∑ balances = 1,000,000,000\nTotal Supply: 1,000,000 (initial) + 1,000,000,000 = 1,001,000,000\nInvariant Status: 1,000,000,000 ≠ 1,001,000,000 -> broken\n\nImpact: First depositor gets 1000x more shares\t\n\n## Recommended mitigation steps\nProper Initial Mint\n```solidity\nconstructor(...) {\n    totalSupply = 1_000_000;\n    _mintVirtual(owner(), 1_000_000);\n}\n```",
